WEBVTT

00:00.610 --> 00:03.180
Tafuta thamani ya a na thibitisha jibu lako.

00:03.180 --> 00:06.054
Na tuna a jumlisha 5 ambayo ni sawa na 54.

00:06.054 --> 00:07.470
Sasa, hapa tuna

00:07.470 --> 00:10.310
namba, na mtajo a.

00:10.310 --> 00:13.484
Na kama nikiongeza 5, nitapata 54.

00:13.484 --> 00:15.400
Na unaweza kufanya hii kwa kichwa.

00:15.400 --> 00:17.820
Lakini tutaifanya kwa utaratibu mzuri zaidi.

00:17.820 --> 00:19.570
Kwa sababu itakusaidia wakati

00:19.570 --> 00:21.070
utakapokutana na hisabati ngumu zaidi.

00:21.070 --> 00:23.361
Kwa ujumla, kila unakapokutana na hisabati kama hii,

00:23.361 --> 00:24.930
tunatakiwa kuwa na mtajo.

00:24.930 --> 00:29.670
Tunataka kuwa na hii a peke yake katika upande mmoja wa swali.

00:29.670 --> 00:31.360
Tunatakiwa kutatua.

00:31.360 --> 00:32.819
Tayari iko upande wa kushoto,

00:32.819 --> 00:34.360
hivyo tuondoe kila kitu

00:34.360 --> 00:35.490
upande wa kushoto.

00:35.490 --> 00:37.490
Vizuri, kitu kilichopo upande wa kushoto

00:37.490 --> 00:38.580
ni hii chanya 5.

00:38.580 --> 00:42.440
Njia nzuri ya kuondoa jumlisha 5, au chanya 5,

00:42.440 --> 00:44.910
ni kutoa 5.

00:44.910 --> 00:46.300
Hivyo hebu tutoe 5.

00:46.300 --> 00:50.110
Lakini kumbuka, hii inasema a jumlisha 5 ni sawa na 54.

00:50.110 --> 00:52.180
Kama tunataka kubaki na usawa,

00:52.180 --> 00:54.430
kitu chochote tunachofanya upande wa kushoto wa swali,

00:54.430 --> 00:57.550
tunatakiwa kufanya na upande wa kulia wa swali.

00:57.550 --> 01:00.660
Kwa hiyo tunatakiwa pia kutoa 54 kutoka kulia.

01:00.660 --> 01:03.090
Kwa hiyo tuna a jumlisha 5 toa 5.

01:03.090 --> 01:05.030
Hiyo itakuwa ni jumlisha 0.

01:05.030 --> 01:08.080
Kwa sababu kama ukijumlisha 5 na ukitoa 5, inakuwa ni 0.

01:08.080 --> 01:10.400
Kwa hiyo a jumlisha 0 ni a.

01:10.400 --> 01:14.520
Na kisha 54 toa 5, hiyo ni 49.

01:14.520 --> 01:15.220
Tumemaliza.

01:15.220 --> 01:16.975
Tumetafuta jibu la a.

01:16.975 --> 01:19.460
A ni sawa na 49.

01:19.460 --> 01:20.810
Na sasa tunaweza kuthibitisha.

01:20.810 --> 01:24.270
Na tunaweza kuthibitisha kwa kuweka 49

01:24.270 --> 01:27.100
katika a kwenye swali la awali.

01:27.100 --> 01:29.600
Kwa hiyo badala ya a jumlisha 5 ni sawa na 54,

01:29.600 --> 01:32.040
hebu tuone kama 49 jumlisha 5 ni sawa na 54.

01:32.040 --> 01:34.010
Kwa hiyo tuweke mbadala.

01:34.010 --> 01:39.920
49 jumlisha-- ngoja nifanye kwa rangi sawa ya kijani.

01:39.920 --> 01:43.730
49 jumlisha 5 ni sawa na 54.

01:43.730 --> 01:45.270
Tunajaribu kuthibitisha hii.

01:45.270 --> 01:48.210
49 jumlisha 5 ni 54.

01:48.210 --> 01:51.140
Na hiyo, kwa hakika, ni sawa na 54.

01:51.140 --> 01:54.080
Hiyo jibu letu ni sahihi.
